   {"src": "NYB", "where": "Manual of Pahlavi II, glossary", "stance": "supports", "note": "NYB_vol2_glossary.txt l. 1411: \"dūt [dwt'] smoke 202°-24. — MPrth dwd (MHC); NP dūd.\""}
