   {"src": "PHD", "where": "CPD p. 28", "stance": "supports", "note": "'dūdag [dwtk | N دوده] family' — MacKenzie explicitly equates MP dūdag with NP دوده."},
   {"src": "BQT", "where": "p. 894", "stance": "supports", "note": "«دوده … و دود چراغ که بجهت ساختن مرکب و سیاهی گیرند» = soot / lamp-black."}
