   {"src": "WLD", "where": "Bd. I 835 ff.", "stance": "silent", "note": "Walde-Pokorny's 'dheu-, dheuə- stieben, wirbeln' lists the verbal formations (ai. dhūnóti, gr. θύω, anord. dyja) without any Avestan member."}
